@startuml seq-uc15-gerar-relatorios-gerenciais
actor Gerente
participant "RelatoriosController" as Controller
participant "AuthMiddleware" as Auth
participant "RelatoriosService" as Service
participant "OrdemServicoRepository" as OSRepo
participant "PagamentoRepository" as PagRepo
participant "PecaRepository" as PecaRepo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Gerente -> Controller: GET /relatorios?tipo=&periodo=\n(JWT)
activate Controller

Controller -> Auth: validarToken(JWT)
activate Auth
Auth --> Controller: payloadUsuario (perfil=Gerente)
deactivate Auth

note right of Controller: Regra: somente o Gerente\ngera relatorios consolidados.

Controller -> Service: gerar(tipo, periodo)
activate Service

Service -> OSRepo: agregarPorStatusEPeriodo(periodo)
activate OSRepo
OSRepo -> DB: SELECT ... GROUP BY status
OSRepo --> Service: dadosOrdens
deactivate OSRepo

Service -> PagRepo: somarFaturamento(periodo)
activate PagRepo
PagRepo -> DB: SELECT SUM(valor) WHERE status='Aprovado'
PagRepo --> Service: faturamento
deactivate PagRepo

Service -> PecaRepo: pecasMaisUtilizadas(periodo)
activate PecaRepo
PecaRepo -> DB: SELECT ... ORDER BY total DESC
PecaRepo --> Service: rankingPecas
deactivate PecaRepo

Service -> Service: consolidarRelatorio(dadosOrdens, faturamento, rankingPecas)
note right of Service: Tipos: faturamento, produtividade,\npecas mais utilizadas, tempo medio,\nOrdem de Servico por status.

Service --> Controller: relatorioDTO
deactivate Service

Controller --> Gerente: 200 OK\nrelatorioDTO (exportavel em PDF/CSV)
deactivate Controller
@enduml
